        "tags": [
          "sign-in"
        ],
        "summary": "Asks for a magic link. The answer is the same for each address (ADR 0008).\nOnly a member gets a mail. Too many requests for one address or from one client get\n`rate-limited` with `Retry-After` (ADR 0056).",
